    complete_plan = eval_plan_anchor + '''\n\ndef planned_complete_run_requests(
    model_count: int,
    locked_task_count: int,
    max_eval_models: int,
) -> dict[str, int]:
    """Plan catalog, complete capability, and fair evaluation requests.

    The evaluation reserve assumes every discovered model could be chat-capable,
    up to ``max_eval_models``. This conservative ceiling is known immediately
    after catalog discovery and therefore protects evaluation capacity before
    the first capability request is sent.

    Args:
        model_count: Number of usable dynamically discovered models.
        locked_task_count: Number of immutable evaluation tasks.
        max_eval_models: Maximum workers admitted to policy comparison.

